<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπενήνεον</span></b> , impf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινηνέω</span> (q. v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπενήνοθε</span></b> , 3sg.
		plpf. and pf., thrice in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>; of Thersites' head, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψεδνὴ ἐ.
		λάχνη</span> a thin coat of downy hair <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grew thereon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.219
			</span></i>; of a cloak, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔλη ἐ.
			λάχνη</span> a thick pile <i>was on</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				10.134
			</span></i>: c. acc., of the ambrosial unguent, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷα θεοὺς ἐ. αἰὲν ἐόντας</span> such as <i>is
			on</i> the gods, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.365
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				62
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>stick to,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στομίοισι πέριξ ἐ. γαστρός,</span> of
			leeches when swallowed, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				509
			</span></i>: perh. related to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανθέω.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλὺς ἐ. αἰών</span>”
				<i>had passed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
				</span></i>
			 R.<i><span class="en">
				4.276
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-, παρ-;</span> also
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήνοθε</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανήνοθε</span> shd. perh. be restored in signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>.)</div>
